{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09515","headline":"对雨愁闷寄钱大郎中 · 刘湾","name":"对雨愁闷寄钱大郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雨细纷纷，饥寒命不分。\n揽衣愁见肘，窥镜觅从文。\n九陌成泥海，千山尽湿云。\n龙锺驱欵段，到处倍思君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}